\li0 \fs20 \par
\li1440 What's New in File & Fo
lder 98'\par
\li2160 \fs16 New features of File & Folder since the Windows 3.11 version. The evolution of the system and the advantages of the 98 version.\par
\li0 \fs20 \par
\li1440 File & Folder Document Management System\par
\li2160 \fs16 Why File
 & Folder? - a detailed description of the idea and the principes. The multi-volume virtual file system at ease.\par
\li0 \fs20 \par
